{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "062181cd9e0cc28034f4c3f75b0665a61e295afe856b8088956335915a0f62f3", "ja": "好きだからこそ", "zh": "正因为喜欢", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "20ff09390dd12fa6fd7f69103f41ec0ff4d3de6e07e55e17734e6ef26033c0da", "ja": "全員での山登り。気晴らしになったと言う\nエミリーに、麗花は「アイドルになってから\nやりたいことがたくさんあって、迷いが増え\nた」と笑う。エミリーは真珠星も同じかも\nしれないと気付き、彼女を信じたいと話す。", "zh": "全员一起爬山。对说这次散心很有效的艾米莉，\n丽花笑着说，成为偶像后想做的事多了，\n迷茫也增加了。艾米莉意识到，真珠星或许也\n是一样，于是说自己想相信她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6b7a709422723428ab5f1e441a806a83196d0d270cf4217cde2478e729f42269", "ja": "（今日は麗花の発案で、みんなで山登りに来た。\nすっきりと晴れて、なによりだな！）", "zh": "（今天应丽花的提议，大家一起来爬山了。\n天气放晴了，真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "af7cdcb68744a2008d9444d8f1faeda72f48e94acb1b5ba354375ffcea8e8d8a", "ja": "天気よし！　靴よし！　おやつよし！\n春日未来、準備万端です！", "zh": "天气没问题！鞋子没问题！点心没问题！\n春日未来，一切准备就绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "13fe3a59aff5688d37fa87dee9f248b75a736f915c3c3e1509cf1bc7f9433110", "ja": "私も私も♪　風向きよし！　お財布よし！\n和三盆よし！　北上麗花も準備万端です！", "zh": "我也我也♪ 风向没问题！钱包没问题！和三盆没问题！北上丽花准备完毕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "83f6b08d54c3c63246e96cd3bdeff2baf941f0a25ab0ad96b027ca6ae9145595", "ja": "麗花さん、未来のノリに\n付き合わなくていいですから……。", "zh": "丽花小姐不用陪未来一起胡闹的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1004_032emi", "source_sha256": "e139c2bd51764713145e26c825b4ed8721c7f1db8e5d2fbaf38e0a293a283143", "ja": "行楽の季節からは外れているのに、\nこちらの山は、とてもにぎわっているんですね。", "zh": "明明已经过了出游的季节，这座山却还是这么热闹呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9ba1a9dadfc198d7bc51fe316fdc5f421b32a95d1b2d1f0f0e5026f99eee4fd8", "ja": "未来とは、前にも来た事があるんだけど……\nこの山は、どの季節でも楽しめるそうだ。", "zh": "未来以前也来过这里，不过……\n听说这座山不管哪个季节都能玩得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "02d916df85680a50b4486c5e875ea5e5f3e024faaeae2967e592acfe517d01f4", "ja": "初心者向けだし、さすが麗花のチョイスだな。", "zh": "毕竟是适合初学者的，真不愧是丽花的选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4e1cf23953ae8abb4648f88f413f40abb9cea06ef32547bc765058c0b44cbd3e", "ja": "けど麗花、どうして山登りなんだ？\nエミリーの悩みと、どう関係があるんだ？", "zh": "不过，丽花，为什么要去爬山？  \n这和艾米莉的烦恼有什么关系？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "10e46afc3b1e8033203e6ac1867d61ea191fb6b39019b8b5b8acc6f8d160cef1", "ja": "山に登ると頭がスッキリしますから。エミリーちゃんの\n迷いが、パーッと晴れたらいいなって♪", "zh": "因为爬山之后头脑会变清醒呀。要是能把艾米莉的\n烦恼全都一扫而空就好了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "b31e7b45da5a53fc6f8c7311dac6dda0853b2b646b483e518bb5a96779729660", "ja": "ありがとうございます。近ごろは毎日、\n台本とにらめっこだったので……。", "zh": "谢谢您。最近每天都在和剧本大眼瞪小眼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "6351c3e719f3ced318b9d1a4efafb596c50f78982f76f61ac8152be7f4c3150b", "ja": "私もね、きれいな鰯雲の理由とか、隣の宇宙の事を\n考えて頭がぐるぐるーってなる時に……。", "zh": "我有时也会因为思考美丽的沙丁鱼云究竟为何形成，还有另一个宇宙的事情，而觉得脑袋转个不停——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "4f8e665638cd757496636a185e698b3ad2c91bb6501ddaac82bd078b32a88caa", "ja": "この山に登って、そんなもやもやが、\nきれいに解決したことがあるんです！　えっへん♪", "zh": "我曾经爬上这座山，把那些乱糟糟的烦恼彻底想通了！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "50f9455a69672a000fea255503609c8e042586e4d1a9e77f4f32f6ddf0699d3c", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nいろいろな思い出があっての事だったんだな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n原来是因为有那么多回忆啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "95d751a6c8ca43e145864a302000b6ea41c2705edc6dfb0663fe8793911f80ac", "ja": "私は、前にも{$P$}さんたちと\n来たことがありますから！　あの時は、たしか……。", "zh": "我以前也和{$P$}先生他们一起来过！我记得那次是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "1dd7d822d899a56027d63d0cc48c032dadb0632570136edd7bfefc5e46739613", "ja": "星梨花とありさちゃんと風花さん、琴葉ちゃんでした！\nあの時は夜だったから、ちょっと雰囲気が違うけど。", "zh": "是和星梨花、亚利沙、风花姐还有琴叶一起来的！  \n不过那时候是晚上，所以气氛有点不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "fbc233e0661e1f915048beae141b9ddacff0aae1d81a40d2fa380fa6e70029e1", "ja": "確か、星を見に行ったんだっけ？\n夜のピクニックなんて、素敵なイベントね。", "zh": "好像是去看星星来着？\n夜晚的野餐，真是个美妙的活动呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "56984c3b9912f347024851c17227c823ec33e0ee5398fa9099cdcc9b9a64bfd4", "ja": "うん！　その時に、\nすっごく素敵なお花畑を見つけたんだ～！", "zh": "嗯！那时候，我们发现了一片特别特别美丽的花田～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "042eb6ff6ccb74552dde77e6e832f556e6d59312331ad03f23dd398e8dc144dd", "ja": "今日も、何か咲いてるかな……？\nみんなで行ってみようね！　絶対気に入ると思うんだ♪", "zh": "今天也不知道会不会有花开呢……？\n我们一起去看看吧！我觉得你们一定会喜欢的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "3f9fc237e217308466e753509a4bb68b98bd484f1b0ffc800a11eee50d790b30", "ja": "わあ……楽しみです♪\nお花、咲いているといいですね♪", "zh": "哇……好期待哦♪\n希望花儿已经开了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "f80980f16dc1b4f65c7b22d1616e266d23f512ea070ec09328c6221f0e41b805", "ja": "それじゃあ、お花畑に寄り道しながら、\nみんなで楽しく頂上を目指しましょう！", "zh": "那么，我们一边顺路去花田看看，\n一边和大家开开心心地向山顶进发吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bef474bc9db455995e6911171583e7efdd43f965ed4a6b310b9d30a3723699a0", "ja": "（突然ではあったけど……麗花の思いつきの登山で、\nチームワークが育めそうだな）", "zh": "（虽然事发突然……不过，跟着丽花突发奇想的登山活动，应该能培养大家的团队合作吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ac51a1dcbaf837ba395f62c32ad57efd726b5e6988b4df7edae2320009e4e774", "ja": "（俺のリュックに、必要な道具は揃えてある。\nみんなをしっかり見守りながら、頂上を目指すぞ！）", "zh": "（我的背包里已经备齐了必要的装备。\n我要好好照看大家，一起向山顶进发！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1022_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1023_032emi", "source_sha256": "1159618b6f311a8cefe2124a6d19f7ac99a2f185a067c019a81d7f74c0e8a1cd", "ja": "やっほーーーーー！！", "zh": "呀吼——————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "1159618b6f311a8cefe2124a6d19f7ac99a2f185a067c019a81d7f74c0e8a1cd", "ja": "やっほーーーーー！！", "zh": "呀吼——————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1025_014mir", "source_sha256": "1159618b6f311a8cefe2124a6d19f7ac99a2f185a067c019a81d7f74c0e8a1cd", "ja": "やっほーーーーー！！", "zh": "呀吼——————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "1159618b6f311a8cefe2124a6d19f7ac99a2f185a067c019a81d7f74c0e8a1cd", "ja": "やっほーーーーー！！", "zh": "呀吼——————！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "0f0a7be2e6602fd87ddb4a5b2d3c8ccae6332dc402b68b94d8673d1a9f7b7def", "ja": "ふう、気持ちいい～♪\nやっぱり頂上にきたら、「ヤッホー！」だよね♪", "zh": "呼——，真舒服～♪\n果然到了山顶，就该喊一声“呀吼——”嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "9b474e89d6c2651d974b1f9bfe31a182273c0476bcb7229ac608109974f7bb28", "ja": "そうね。実際に山に登ってみたら、\n叫びたくなる気持ちが少しわかったかも。", "zh": "是啊。真的爬上山之后，好像也有点明白为什么会想喊出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1029_032emi", "source_sha256": "2e1adf1eb03ef575b19cfe3df297536dd64dd714cd18075eb64a35ef0fce7e2b", "ja": "はい。お花畑も、素敵でした！\nまるで夢みたいな光景で……♪", "zh": "是的。花田也很美！\n简直就像梦境一样的景色……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "2a235334625ff0c0401b1f04539d2ec98d031b662ff750157a9f10c6b579f4fb", "ja": "……すこし、心が軽くなった気がします。\n頭もすっきりして、とてもいい気晴らしになりました。", "zh": "……感觉心情也稍微轻松了一些。\n脑子也清醒了不少，真是一次很好的消遣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "16e1c96e6590211bd36ff858c9c4f09a27c33385ae8b76e483cc0eb3b596205c", "ja": "それならよかった♪\n私は……なんだか、迷いが増えちゃったかも？", "zh": "那就太好了♪\n我……好像反而更迷茫了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "0ff156eaedd86669407aceb315caf2c1e85f216db62c4cd57bc4ef47ad026b97", "ja": "えっ！？\nそ、そうなんですか？　麗花さん。", "zh": "诶！？\n是、是这样吗？丽花姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "7b4f1bdb4770996d0963b8c7920b1f5850d2684f9f6175cc16b699341be28e04", "ja": "うん！　今日みんなと山登りしたのが、\nとっても楽しかったから……。", "zh": "嗯！因为今天和大家一起爬山特别开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "6f6973e5b2a3bea944b33fc9a3d9f654d78c03411e03d4eb854efcec304485bd", "ja": "いつか、登山ライブがしたいなーって♪\nそう思ったら、いろいろ迷っちゃって！", "zh": "我想什么时候能办一场登山演唱会呢——♪\n这么一想，就不由得开始纠结各种事情了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "85eaa84c068daa1f2da4825de525e3679de0d530d408647117b6934b3799f666", "ja": "と、登山ライブ……？\nすごい企画を思いつくな、麗花……。", "zh": "登、登山演唱会……？\n真亏你能想出这么厉害的企划，丽花……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1036_014mir", "source_sha256": "da23c6c0f0ba08f6dfb2ca33ebd2ceb621be26b6f15c6dc139c192576c982537", "ja": "山の頂上でライブ、すっごく気持ちよさそう！\n私もやってみた～い♪", "zh": "在山顶办演出，感觉会超级舒服！\n我也想试试看～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "b714e031564da09e4fe7e79c861a758ce8355f53eebcf8c644104e7f383e2ec8", "ja": "体力的な不安が大きい気がするけど……。\nお客さんも、登山で会場に来るのかな……。", "zh": "感觉体力方面的担忧会比较大……  \n客人们也要爬山来会场吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "1ec791bb043e03be872fe23360ff1819346d6f55dab467f55882211bf345c48f", "ja": "私、歌を歌うのも、山に登るのも、\n同じくらい大好きなんですけど……。", "zh": "我既喜欢唱歌，也喜欢爬山，\n两样都一样喜欢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "40d5b4ca2e5be8757fbfca956d98d51d518f61c23aacb52aa7d79c0186a3e2ee", "ja": "あれもしたいなー、これもしたいなーって、\nちっともひとつに絞れなくて。", "zh": "想做这个，又想做那个，\n根本没办法只选定一个呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "8d60e9e3ae565271ead7ab3e925992d867026c9ee1d3e8bc96621e37fca453d9", "ja": "もしかしたら私、アイドルになってから、\nず～っと迷ってるのかも！", "zh": "说不定我从成为偶像开始，\n就一～直在迷茫呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1041_032emi", "source_sha256": "92a148097ca6d73659c3157ac05a1693c31e554b39ff38bec3eccd9a8090d1b4", "ja": "アイドルになってから……\nずっと、迷っている……。", "zh": "成为偶像之后……\n一直，都在迷茫……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1042_p", "source_sha256": "f8b52ea268841fd1c3f05c944592d5b83ced52535832b11187b6f47f50f67f7f", "ja": "迷う理由にも、人それぞれあるな。", "zh": "每个人迷茫的理由都不一样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "06212c767fd9ee5854da4c3763c7b02c4030fd2656b87b2039fecd6ab5c0af28", "ja": "麗花の言う「全部やりたくて選べない」っていうのも\n……変な言い方だけど、立派な迷いだろうし。", "zh": "丽花所说的“想全部都做，所以没法选择”，虽然说法有点奇怪，但也算是一种很了不起的烦恼吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "115cc736746a22b4320c27704b22a44847e275974df8640c2b2a9861d4365dab", "ja": "はい。……私も、みなさんとやりたいお仕事や舞台は、\nまだ山のようにあって……。", "zh": "是的……我也还有堆积如山的、想和大家一起完成的工作和舞台……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1045_p", "source_sha256": "01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69", "ja": "うん。", "zh": "嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1046_032emi", "source_sha256": "00910cbb8a0315a9c059464353aaa058ddbcc54ffb72508fde460b6c978ca77d", "ja": "でも、真珠星は……最初は、お医者様になりたくて。\nなのにお姉さんが亡くなってしまって、代わりに……。", "zh": "但是，真珠星……一开始，是想成为医生的。\n可是姐姐去世了，于是便代替她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "7c58a27409706564941f94c6e0454de1a98cbaac46f92f78b5c7976c099afbf7", "ja": "だから、『何故、大和撫子をしているのか』と\n悩むのは、ある意味、当然のことです……。", "zh": "所以，会苦恼“为什么要成为大和抚子”，从某种意义上说也是理所当然的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1048_p", "source_sha256": "f63281d82d9b21d4920efb4f64d93b6f5ab5d5b1ceb29f18a02b0c4ba86e5989", "ja": "うん。けど、そんな真珠星の中にも\nいつの間にか……。", "zh": "嗯。不过，不知不觉间，\n那样的真珠星心中也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1049_p", "source_sha256": "f69feaec31099b1edc7a075fce08cf1194922382060647157e5e3c76f79e0c1a", "ja": "アイドルへの思いが、できていたんじゃないかな。\n本人も、気付いていないのかもしれないけど。", "zh": "对偶像的感情，不知不觉间已经产生了吧。\n也许连她自己都没有察觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1050_032emi", "source_sha256": "8e312c70f149ef7b335ed86f57583ada743b4fed911e829acf46b240a08315a0", "ja": "真珠星はもう、どちらかを選べないくらい……\n大和撫子のことが、大切になっていて……だから……。", "zh": "真珠星已经变得如此珍视大和抚子，甚至到了无法二选一的地步……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1051_032emi", "source_sha256": "28763caada2cbefd456dd6a93ff86358179ecf503352b3626891ed703a5dc74b", "ja": "私は、真珠星のこと……\nそう信じたいです！", "zh": "关于真珠星的事……\n我想相信那就是事实！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1052_033sih", "source_sha256": "5cda86cfbbb76b0f3aa517dfed8e5c26987ef61ede11cc903e1bf8d10d8a4f05", "ja": "素敵な解釈ね。\nいいと思う。", "zh": "很棒的解读呢。我觉得不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "0aa657b7a125aa73b1c8cca090a3daad69d5b2727150f92b2cfb1cc22fe4cc20", "ja": "うんうん♪　私も、\n真珠星はアイドルが好きだと思うなー。", "zh": "嗯嗯♪我也觉得，真珠星应该是喜欢偶像的吧——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1054_014mir", "source_sha256": "286dda47ac03874ab34fdb7f838b9ca5a1d267ec2a156eca47bcd44f0a5ee88d", "ja": "もし本当にどうでもよかったら、「なんでアイドル\nやってるんだろう」なんて、迷ったりしないよね？", "zh": "如果真的觉得无所谓，就不会因为“为什么要当偶像”这种事而感到迷茫了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1055_p", "source_sha256": "b50c3dfe9ac82ac42f4103be7d0d1b5afbf6fa4e8b6b03d5b7856dd7e7655949", "ja": "エミリーなりの答えが出せたみたいだな。\n次の稽古は、その方向でやってみよう！", "zh": "看来艾米莉似乎已经找到了属于她自己的答案。\n下次排练就朝着那个方向试试吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1056_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1057_048rei", "source_sha256": "8a0485075b269a9a9677cf8bdb5a0c0e331620ca13a9f9b6e92963966b16f662", "ja": "エミリーちゃんのお顔、なんだかスッキリしてるね。\nみんなで登山、大成功です♪", "zh": "艾米莉的表情感觉很舒畅呢。\n大家一起登山，大成功♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_03_1058_p", "source_sha256": "34f10bd9bbc76c9cdc247595196c38091a0933bddffd35d23dbd345ce6f8291a", "ja": "（山に登って迷いが晴れる、か。\nここからのみんなのお芝居に、注目だな！）", "zh": "（爬上山就能解开心结吗。接下来大家的演出，值得期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
